  "caveats": [
    "The Eddas refer to nine worlds but do not supply one universally agreed canonical nine-world chart.",
    "Kelippot/Qliphoth has multiple Jewish mystical layers; the fixed tenfold demonic counter-tree is especially a later Western occult system.",
    "Bardo is specific to Tibetan Buddhist traditions and should not stand for Buddhism as a whole.",
    "Dao is not a personal creator equivalent to Father/God.",
    "Potatoverse correspondences are project comparisons, not external proof of Potatoist theology."
  ]
